    "sections": {
        "description": "DigitalGrid is a high-performance child theme of DigitalGrove, crafted for businesses, consulting firms, and SEO agencies that demand flexibility and full-site editing (FSE) capabilities. Seamlessly integrated with Gutenberg and WooCommerce, DigitalGrid offers effortless customization and robust eCommerce features. Its modern, block-based design, built-in SEO optimization, and compatibility with Contact Form 7 make it the ideal solution for showcasing your services, engaging clients, and expanding your digital footprint. Elevate your brand with DigitalGrid—where innovation drives results. Demo: https://demos.themegrove.com/digitalgrid/"
    },
